==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|réviser}}, from {{der|en|la|revīsō}}, from {{m|la|re-}} + {{m|la|vīsō||examine}}, frequentative of {{m|la|videō||see}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈvaɪz/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈvaɪz/|/ɹəˈvaɪz/|a=UK,GA,CA}}
** {{audio|en|En-us-revise.ogg|a=California}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈvɑez/|/ɹəˈvɑez/|a=AU}}
